### PATCH insurance
PATCH {{host}}/api/insurances/{{id}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "companyName": "RGU Insurance"
}

### PUT insurance
PUT {{host}}/api/insurances/{{id}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "companyName": "RGU Insurance",
  "address": "28 RGU Street, Aberdeen, AB11 5YU",
  "phoneNumber": "024-135-7698"
}

### DELETE insurance
DELETE {{host}}/api/insurances/{{id}}